<title>DENMARK: FORECAST-Analysts see fewer Danish August jobless.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-Analysts see fewer Danish August jobless.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine analysts polled by Reuters on Tuesday forecast average August unemployment of 8.9 percent.</p>
<p>Estimates spanned from 8.7 percent to 9.1 percent.</p>
<p>The national statistics office releases its August unemployment data on Thursday October 3.</p>
<p>July unemployment in Denmark was 9.1 percent of the workforce.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
